# Files dropped on the window (scripts\verify\panel.ps1, part drop), live:
#   RayTracingViewer cornell -w 320 --height 180 -s 16 --input tests\window-drop.input --record r.txt
# A file dropped is shown as a model, in the photo studio, as the panel's Open... shows one; a file that isn't a glTF
# model, and one the loader refuses, leave the scene shown, and the console says why. Relative paths are this file's
# folder's.
at 0 action panel on
at 10 drop "..\assets\models\brass_vase_01\brass_vase_01_1k.gltf"
at 40 drop "..\README.md"
at 50 drop "data\cut-short.glb"
# Saved: the model's file names the files (brass_vase_01_1k-view-001.png)
at 80 action save
at 100 quit
